---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout title={SITE_TITLE}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-page px-6 py-32">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Phase 0 skeleton</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl font-bold">Vince Caldwell</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-prose text-lg text-muted">
      If this renders on a dark charcoal background in Inter, with the eyebrow above in cyan
      JetBrains Mono, then the token system, the Tailwind bridge and the Fonts API are all wired
      correctly.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
